<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn cattle lightly traded - private.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn cattle lightly traded - private.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live slaughter steers and heifers not well tested. Trade slow. Demand moderate to good.</p>
<p>Seller interest light. Offerings light.</p>
<p>Confirmed Sales:    900 Week Ago:  8,100 Year Ago:  5,000</p>
<p>Week to Date:    29,500 Week Ago: 28,900 Year Ago: 41,200</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 71.00-72.00.</p>
<p>    Heifers: Mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld   73.00</p>
<p>Carcass Basis (weight only). Slaughter steers and heifers steady to firm in a light test.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1300 lbs 115.00-116.00, few 116.50.</p>
<p>Holstein: (weight only) Select to mostly Choice 2-3</p>
<p>1250-1400 lbs 105.00-106.00</p>
<p>Holsteins: ( grade &amp; weight)</p>
<p>Choice 2-3 1250-1450 lbs			 ld     106.00</p>
<p>Select 2-3 1250-1450 lbs				  101.00</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1050-1200 lbs 115.00-116.00.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
